<title>Document</title></head><body><div id="i0b58a205689b44988d525c526b7b790a_1"></div><div style="min-height:40.5pt;width:100%"><div><font><br></font></div></div><div style="text-align:right"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Exhibit 99.1</font></div><div><img alt="seagatelogo.jpg" src="seagatelogo.jpg" style="height:54px;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:166px"></div><div style="text-align:right"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Investor Relations Contact&#58;</font></div><div style="text-align:right"><font style="color:#242424;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Shanye Hudson, (510) 661-1600</font></div><div style="text-align:right"><font style="color:#242424;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">shanye.hudson&#64;seagate.com</font></div><div style="text-align:right"><font><br></font></div><div style="text-align:right"><font style="color:#242424;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Media Contact&#58;</font></div><div style="text-align:right"><font style="color:#242424;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Carrie Schafer, (303) 941-9470  </font></div><div style="text-align:right"><font style="color:#242424;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">carrie.schafer&#64;seagate.com</font></div><div style="text-align:center"><font><br></font></div><div style="margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:center"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:174%">SEAGATE TECHNOLOGY REPORTS FISCAL FIRST QUARTER 2027 FINANCIAL RESULTS</font></div><div style="text-align:justify"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Fiscal Q1 2027 Highlights</font></div><div style="padding-left:36pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">&#9642;</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:14.46pt">Revenue of $4.2 billion</font></div><div style="padding-left:36pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">&#9642;</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:14.46pt">GAAP gross margin of 57.3%&#59;  non-GAAP gross margin of 57.8%</font></div><div style="padding-left:36pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">&#9642;</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:14.46pt">GAAP diluted earnings per share (EPS) of $7.59&#59; non-GAAP diluted EPS of $7.68</font></div><div style="padding-left:36pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">&#9642;</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:14.46pt">Cash flow from operations of $1.7 billion and free cash flow of $1.5 billion</font></div><div style="padding-left:36pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">&#9642;</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:14.46pt">Retired $1.2 billion of debt and returned $568 million to shareholders through dividends and share repurchases </font></div><div style="padding-left:36pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">&#9642;</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:14.46pt">Increased quarterly cash dividend by approximately 3% to $0.76 per share </font></div><div><font><br></font></div><div style="margin-bottom:5pt;margin-top:5pt;text-align:justify"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Singapore</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"> &#8211; October 28, 2026 - Seagate Technology Holdings plc (NASDAQ&#58; STX) (the &#8220;Company&#8221; or &#8220;Seagate&#8221;), a leading innovator of mass-capacity data storage, today reported financial results for its fiscal first quarter ended October 2, 2026.</font></div><div style="margin-bottom:5pt;margin-top:5pt;text-align:justify"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">&#8220;Seagate delivered another quarter of record profitability and our highest ever free cash flow in the September quarter, demonstrating the earnings power of our business amid a strengthening demand environment,&#8221; said Dave Mosley, Seagate's chair and chief executive officer.</font></div><div style="margin-bottom:5pt;margin-top:5pt;text-align:justify"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">&#8220;Data creation, retention and reuse continue to compound storage demand with long term customer demand visibility reinforcing our view of a multi-year growth phase. Our HAMR-based technology roadmap enables us to address growing exabyte demand through areal density gains while maintaining supply discipline. Combined with our value-based pricing strategy and strengthened balance sheet, we believe Seagate can&#8239;deliver profitable growth, strong cash generation and increased shareholder returns over the long term,&#8221; Mosley concluded. </font></div><div style="text-align:justify"><font><br></font></div><div style="margin-bottom:5pt;margin-top:5pt"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Quarterly Financial Results</font></div><div style="margin-bottom:10pt;margin-top:5pt;text-align:center"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:98.391%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:35.304%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:13.313%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:2.177%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:13.313%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:1.434%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:13.313%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:1.434%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:13.612%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"></td><td colspan="9" style="padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">GAAP</font></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"></td><td colspan="9" style="padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><font style="color:#00